    "result_text": "The full test suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`). \n\n## Summary\n\nThe requirement was to return `selfLink = '/api/owners/' + <new owner id>` on the owner response. The `OwnerDto` is generated at build time from the OpenAPI spec and populated by MapStruct, so I made two changes:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a `selfLink` (read-only string) property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` gains the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping` for `selfLink` computing `\"/api/owners/\" + owner.getId()` (null when the owner has no id yet).\n\nThe acceptance test `coreReturnsSelfLink` \u2014 which creates an owner via `POST /api/owners` and reads `$.selfLink` back via `GET /api/owners/{id}` \u2014 now passes, along with the rest of the suite.",
